        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b21ebeb7-02d8-54c6-af6f-e7882af618af",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jimmy Barnes, Yang Seung-ho\n- Organizations: Cold Chisel, MBLAQ, Will Entertainment\n- Roles: rock singer-songwriter, lead vocalist, idol singer, dancer, actor, model, leader\n- Places: Australia, Scotland, South Korea\n\nFacts:\n- Jimmy Barnes, born James Dixon Swan on 28 April 1956, is a Scottish-Australian rock singer-songwriter.\n- Jimmy Barnes was the lead vocalist of the rock band Cold Chisel and also built a solo career.\n- Cold Chisel had 14 Australian Top 40 albums, and Jimmy Barnes had 13 charting solo albums, including nine No. 1 albums.\n- Jimmy Barnes has the highest number of hit albums of any Australian artist.\n- Yang Seung-ho was born on 16 October 1987 and is a South Korean idol singer, dancer, actor, and model.\n- Yang Seung-ho is the leader of the Korean male group MBLAQ and is active in South Korea under Will Entertainment.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "8d004cf0-3b66-5c99-8973-d484995f28d4",
        "text": "Page: Jimmy Barnes. Sentence: James Dixon Swan {'1': \", '2': \", '3': \", '4': \"} (born 28 April 1956), better known as Jimmy Barnes, is a Scottish-Australian rock singer-songwriter.\nPage: Jimmy Barnes. Sentence: His career both as a solo performer and as the lead vocalist with the rock band Cold Chisel has made him one of the most popular and best-selling Australian music artists of all time.\nPage: Jimmy Barnes. Sentence: The combination of 14 Australian Top 40 albums for Cold Chisel and 13 charting solo albums, including nine No. 1s, gives Barnes the highest number of hit albums of any Australian artist.\nPage: Yang Seung-ho. Sentence: Yang Seung-ho (양승호; born October 16, 1987), is a South Korean idol singer, dancer, actor, model and the leader of Korean male group MBLAQ, currently active in South Korea under Will Entertainment.",
